You can still use all local UK apps and sites while unblocking US channels with Smart[ DNS]. Your IP address is left unchanged.
No need to install or download software. Smart[ DNS] can be configured directly on your device. All you need is access to your device’s network settings.
Some[ ISPs] uses transparent[ proxies] or[ DNS] hijacking. Either method might prevent Smart[ DNS] from functioning properly.
There are quite a few Smart[ DNS] services available


